		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=14301#p14301"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>You&#039;re on a french board, any chance you speak french ?</p><p>It sounds like an IO error.<br />Were you running a query when it happened ?<br />What does these query show ?</p><br /><p>select datname,oid from pg_database where oid = 16403<br />This should give you the database where the error happened.<br />On this database:</p><br /><p>SELECT oid,relname,relfilenode<br />FROM pg_class<br />WHERE oid = 17885 or relfilenode = 17885;</p>]]></content>
